    "reporter": "菩提祖師",
    "rootcause": "Root cause of the CPLD failing to update the vGPIO status under this specific stress sequence involves a race condition, priority conflict, and state-machine desynchronization between the BMC and the CPLD:\n1. BMC-Induced I2C/SMBus Arbitration Lock (Bus Congestion).\n2. State Machine Race Condition & Asynchronous Reset Timing.\n3. PFR (Platform Firmware Resilience) or ERoT / Security Handshake Overhead.",
